# Optional. The app renders the whole model from the bundled asset and needs none of this;
# these exist for the roadmap path where Supabase serves a read-only mirror of the bundle.
#
# Only EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables reach the app, and Expo INLINES them into the shipped
# JavaScript. The anon key is the only key that may ever appear here. A service-role key
# placed in this file would be published to every install; __tests__/security.test.ts fails
# the build on any EXPO_PUBLIC_ name that looks like a secret.
#
# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
